  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "956003d1-1ca3-4f9f-9492-02f77afe12e2"],
 " evaluates it. It contains only public symbols: a lattice is an explicit ",
 Cell[BoxData["Graph"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f9863ddb-973f-4797-a0ee-92ee007d237f"],
